  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Kenya Social and Economic Inclusion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KSEIP2 will build on the outcomes and lessons from KSEIP to expand and improve cash-based and shock-responsive social assistance and economic inclusion programs for poor and vulnerable households. KSEIP2 will scale up successful cash-plus pilots to improve human capital and build sustainable livelihoods, pilot new innovations to deepen Kenya&apos;s social safety net using a life-cycle approach, and strengthen delivery systems for improved efficiency and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To promote economic resilience of poor and vulnerable households and strengthen the adaptive social protection system</narrative>
  </description>
